			"notes": "MC Stats 2.0.0 targets **Minecraft Java 26.3**.\n\n- Requires JDK 25, Fabric Loader 0.20.1 or newer, and Fabric API for Minecraft 26.3 (built against 0.166.2+26.3).\n- Updates the build to stable Fabric Loom 1.19.4 and Gradle 9.8.0.\n- Corrects repository links in the mod metadata and updates compatibility documentation.\n\nInstall `mcstats-2.0.0.jar` on the server, replacing the older MC Stats jar. Preserve `config/mcstats.json` and existing world data. Clients do not need MC Stats. The `-sources.jar` asset is for source inspection, not installation.\n\nValidation: the JDK 25 build passed locally on the server and in GitHub Actions. An isolated Minecraft 26.3 server loaded the complete mod set, and a disposable Carpet player produced flushed vanilla stats, jump, custom death and natural mining events through the logging backend. The live server completed its world upgrade and answered public status and RCON checks. The existing production webhook configuration was preserved; no synthetic player stats were sent to it.\n\nSource: main commit `49f5d75e1474445d623b326b190c9099c675380e` ([PR #2](https://github.com/sybrengg/mcstats/pull/2))."
		},
